{{ if model.angular_cognito_enabled && model.web_admin_layout }}
# My Workspace

This authenticated, web-only domain is included by default in compatible Angular monolith prints.
The host registers its lazy route and sidebar link from `domain.json`; no platform route or navigation
registration is part of this folder.

The UI calls the REST Workspace Tasks API through `@forge/ui-contracts/v1`. Its configured
`apiPath` is relative to the receiving platform's public `apiUrl` (the default `/api` plus
`/v1/workspace/tasks` produces the API path `/api/v1/workspace/tasks`). The platform supplies the
runtime API origin and bearer authentication. Do not copy tokens, host imports, or tenant/user
selectors into this domain.

The generated REST API must separately include Workspace Tasks and its PostgreSQL migration. The
domain never uses mock data. See the generated REST print's Workspace Tasks reference for the API
contract, ownership rules, and deployment/migration prerequisites.

The domain owns its request/response contracts, API client, route-scoped Signals state, task editor,
tests, and these usage notes. It uses only relative URLs and public V1 contracts so the complete
`workspace` folder can be copied unchanged into another compatible print.
{{ end }}
